  "description": "ISO 14229 (UDS) protocol implementation for .NET 10, transported over ISO-TP (Oakrey.ISOTP). UnifiedDiagnosticServices exposes async, CancellationToken-aware methods for DiagnosticSessionControl, EcuReset, ReadDataByIdentifier, WriteDataByIdentifier, ReadDtcInformation, ClearDiagnosticTroubleCodes, and SecurityAccess (seed/key). Responses are returned as UdsResponse value types with a UdsResponseResult discriminator.",
